<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/topbar') %><main class="content narrow"><form class="card create-card" method="post" action="/posts/create" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-stream-upload-form data-clip-mode="<%=typeof isClip!=='undefined'&&isClip?'1':'0'%>">
  <div class="clip-upload-heading"><span><i data-lucide="clapperboard"></i> <%=typeof isClip!=='undefined'&&isClip?'Lumi Clip · maksimum 30 soniya':'Yangi post'%></span><a href="/clips">Clipsni ko‘rish →</a></div><div class="upload-preview multi-preview" data-preview><i data-lucide="images"></i><p>1–10 ta rasm yoki video tanlang</p><span>Katta media Render RAM’ida ushlanmaydi — oqim bilan Cloudflare R2’ga uzatiladi</span></div><%if(error){%><div class="alert"><%=error%></div><%}%>
  <label class="file-btn"><input type="file" name="images" accept="<%=typeof isClip!=='undefined'&&isClip?'video/mp4,video/webm':'image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif,video/mp4,video/webm'%>" <%=typeof isClip!=='undefined'&&isClip?'':'multiple'%> data-multi-image-input><i data-lucide="upload"></i> Media tanlash</label>
  <div class="stream-progress" data-stream-progress hidden><div><span data-stream-progress-label>Media yuklanmoqda…</span><b data-stream-progress-value>0%</b></div><progress max="100" value="0" data-stream-progress-bar></progress><small class="muted">Sahifani yopmang. Video va katta fayllar to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri R2 oqimiga yuboriladi.</small></div>
  <section class="clip-upload-info"><i data-lucide="wand-sparkles"></i><span data-clip-video-hint>Video muqovasi avtomatik tayyorlanadi. Clips uchun 9:16 tavsiya qilinadi.</span></section>
<div class="clip-caption-row"><label>Subtitr (.srt/.vtt)<input type="file" accept=".srt,.vtt,text/vtt" data-captions-file></label>
<label>Til<select data-captions-lang><option value="uz">O‘zbek</option><option value="ru">Русский</option><option value="en">English</option></select></label></div>
<p class="muted tiny">Subtitr ixtiyoriy (32 KB gacha). Nutqdan avtomatik subtitr yaratish hozircha ulanmagan.</p>
<label class="mention-field">Caption<textarea name="caption" maxlength="2200" rows="4" placeholder="Bugungi kayfiyat... @username ✨" data-mention-input></textarea><div class="mention-suggestions" data-mention-suggestions hidden></div><small class="muted">@username mention va #tag ishlaydi.</small></label><label>Taglar<input name="tags" placeholder="#beauty #style #goodvibes"></label>
  <% if(freshPostsEnabled){ %><p class="muted tiny" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px"><i data-lucide="timer"></i> Lumi Fresh: yangi postlar 24 soatdan keyin avtomatik o‘chadi. Xotirada abadiy qolmaydi.</p><% } %>
  <div class="profile-library"><button class="btn primary" type="submit" formaction="/posts/create">Postni joylash</button><button class="btn ghost" type="submit" formaction="/posts/create-draft" formnovalidate><i data-lucide="file-clock"></i> Qoralama saqlash</button></div><p class="muted tiny">Joylash uchun kamida 1 media kerak. Qoralamani caption bilan mediasiz ham saqlash mumkin. Maksimum 10 media. Video maksimum 30 soniya va <%=currentUser?.proExpiresAt&&new Date(currentUser.proExpiresAt)>new Date()?150:80%> MB/fayl.</p>
</form></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
